[[512,127,16,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the two fans \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery from the lines of the two maxifuses FAN1\nand FAN2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : the fans operate when they receive an earth\ncommand.</p><p>The relays \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J32</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nspecific to the cooling system, receive supply to their coils from\nthe direct line (EFI) protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>They are energized by an earth signal coming\nfrom the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the engine coolant temperature reaches\nthe first temperature stage, or the 4 stage pressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n3) signals to the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               that the first pressure\nstage has been reached, then the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends an\nearth signal to the 1st speed fan relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes\nthe coil. The relay then sends an earth which, via the additional\nresistors \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>O10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>O12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , operates both fans \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which rotate at the first (slow) speed.</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a higher temperature\nlevel, or the 4 stage pressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 6) signals\nto the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               that a higher pressure level has\nbeen reached, then the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends an earth signal\nto the two 2nd speed fan relays \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J32</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nenergize the coils.  The two relays then send an earth directly\nto the two fans \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which rotate at maximum\nspeed.</p>"]]